  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Puneriya Shiva Kumar vs Sub Inspector Of Police on 21 September, 2020 Author: K. Lakshman Bench: K. Lakshman Honourable Sri Justice K. Lakshman Criminal Petition No.4077 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This application is filed under Section 482 Cr.P.C. to quash the proceedings in Crime No.153 of 2020, pending on the file of Shahinayathgunj Police Station, Hyderabad City against petitioners - accused Nos.1 and 2. The petitioners are Accused Nos.1 and 2 in the said crime. The offences alleged against them are under Sections 188 and 269 read with 34 of IPC and Section 51(1) of the Disaster Management Act, 2005.",
    "arguments": "2. The learned counsel for the petitioners as well as the learned Assistant Public Prosecutor would submit that the subject matter is squarely covered by a common order dated 27.08.2018, passed by the High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the States of Telangana and Andhra Pradesh in Crl.P. No.3731 of 2018 and batch, and placed copy of the said judgment for perusal.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. The learned counsel for the petitioners as well as the learned Assistant Public Prosecutor would submit that the subject matter is squarely covered by a common order dated 27.08.2018, passed by the High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the States of Telangana and Andhra Pradesh in Crl.P. No.3731 of 2018 and batch, and placed copy of the said judgment for perusal.",
